+
+The source supplement contains parameter hashes, prediction locks and both complete score tables. Its count-to-input-to-prediction replay reconstructs the saved repeat predictions and scores with maximum difference zero; independent MSE recomputation agrees within 3.56e-15. The manuscript integration independently recomputes all 63 reconstructed score rows and checks endpoint preservation, equal partner predictions for the same-alpha policies, and the complete/partner SSE identity. `revision/han/ANALYSIS_SCOPE.json` records this calculation, while `code/integrate_han_v34.py` reproduces Tables S45-S50 from locked arrays. These computational checks establish reproducibility of the stated analysis, not a larger number of biological validations.
